    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Department of Paediatric and Child Health, in partnership with CIME, has successfully organised the first-ever Paediatric Critical Care Simulation Series (PCCSS). The aim is to equip healthcare providers in paediatric critical care with essential skills and knowledge to effectively manage critically ill children.",
